Exclusion Criteria:

1. The following laboratory indicators belong to the exclusion criteria:

1. Absolute neutrophil count (ANC) \ 1.5 times the upper limit of normal value (ULN); Patients with liver metastasis \> 2.5 times ULN;
3. Aspartate aminotransferase (AST) and alanine aminotransferase (ALT) \> 2.5 times ULN, or ALT and / or ast \> 5 times ULN in patients with liver metastasis;
