Inclusion Criteria:

1. ≧ 60 years old;
2. communicate normally；
3. ASA Physical Status 1-2;
4. Patients will have elective orthopedics, urology or general surgeries under general anesthesia;
5. With an estimated surgery time of more than 2h;
