12. People with the following infectious diseases are not allowed to join the group:

1. HBsAg is positive and the HBV DNA copy number is greater than the upper limit of normal value (1000 copies/ml or 500IU/ml) in the laboratory of the research center;
2. HCV positive (HCV RNA or HCV Ab detection indicates acute or chronic infection);
3. Known history of HIV positivity or known acquired immunodeficiency syndrome;
13. Have undergone major surgery within 28 days before the screening period, or plan to undergo major surgery during the study period;
