Inclusion Criteria:

1. Age 18-80 years, gender is not limited;
2. Acute ischemic stroke of anterior circulation was diagnosed clinically
3. mRS 0-1 score before onset;
4. 6 ≤ NIHSS ≤25 at randomization;
